   DEF: Modify or remove database objects
   WHEN: Change table structure or delete objects
   WHERE: Database structure management


   ALTER TABLE
   DEF: Modify the structure of an existing table


   ADD COLUMN
   INPUT: ALTER TABLE student
          ADD COLUMN email VARCHAR(100);

   OUTPUT: New email column added
   REAL: Add a new field to an existing table


   MODIFY COLUMN
   INPUT: ALTER TABLE student
          MODIFY COLUMN name VARCHAR(100);

   OUTPUT: Name column size changed
