   RENAME COLUMN
   INPUT: ALTER TABLE student
          RENAME COLUMN name TO full_name;

   OUTPUT: name changed to full_name
   REAL: Rename a field


   DROP COLUMN
   INPUT: ALTER TABLE student
          DROP COLUMN email;

   OUTPUT: Email column removed
   REAL: Remove an unnecessary field


   RENAME TABLE
   INPUT: ALTER TABLE student
          RENAME TO students;

   OUTPUT: Table name changed
   REAL: Rename a table


   DROP
   DEF: Permanently removes a database object


   DROP TABLE
   INPUT: DROP TABLE student;

   OUTPUT: Table and its data are removed
   REAL: Delete an unwanted table


   DROP DATABASE
   INPUT: DROP DATABASE school;

   OUTPUT: Entire database is removed
   REAL: Delete an unused database


   IMPORTANT:

   ALTER → Table structure change
   DROP  → Object permanently remove

